// model reported or already inside the title the source printed. "GR" and "GRAM(S)" are the
// same measurement spelled longer and normalise to the same "180g"; a G with no digit in
// front of it ("BIG", "G-FUNK") is not a weight and is left alone.
// v50: ACCENTED LETTERS ARE NOT LETTERS HERMES TAKES. "Héritage by Toumani Diabaté" went
// into the catalog with its accents intact and Hermes will not have them (client,
// 2026-09-07). Every letter that is a plain Latin letter wearing a mark is folded down to
// the letter: é->e, ç->c, ã->a, ø->o, ß->ss.
