// v41: A SEVEN-INCH SINGLE IS NOT AN LP. Warner print the format inside the title —
// "Zoom Zoom the Little Boy / Without Music the World Dies (7\" Black Vinyl)" — and the word
// "vinyl" is all a model needs to answer "LP". It is a 7" single: a different product at a
// different price on a different shelf, and the client has added 7" to the glossary
// (client, 2026-08-21).
//
